    {
      "id": "claim_6a2823ebbc8f4ec2b70796d560761611",
      "statement": "`GitHubService` exposes exactly two write operations — post an issue comment and close an issue with state reason `Not_planned` — and no label, pull request, review, or merge operation, which makes the PRD's label transitions and PR creation stages unimplemented rather than mis-wired.",
      "evidence": [
        {
