    {
      "id": "claim_7dfb311d8eb84dba9baae9853ccc934b",
      "statement": "Configuration carries no cost, budget, or rate-limit surface: `SebastianConfig` has only `GitHub` and `Agent` sections, and the agent section holds provider name, endpoint, api key, and model id, so the PRD's per-run and per-day cost ceilings have no code behind them.",
