    {
      "id": "claim_52d1680e26e34d3bbe5ee35a8917e969",
      "statement": "Only `IssuesEvent` and `PushEvent` are routed by the webhook processor; push deliveries synchronously call `Git.SyncMainAsync` inside the request, and every other event type — including pull request and issue comment events, which is where a `merge` command would have to arrive — falls through to the base processor and does nothing.",
