      "statement": "There is no automated coverage of the intake layer: the only tests pin spec-section validation and workspace preparation (worktree reuse, recreation after directory removal, rejection of dirty local `main`, rejection of a foreign repository), so adding an intake or GitHub-write stage requires adding its own tests.",
