      "statement": "The `needs-triage` waiting state and every label transition in the PRD state machine are absent: both label constants (`feature`, `ready-for-agent`) are read-only filters matched case-insensitively against the event payload, and nothing in the codebase writes a label, so all state movement is enforced entirely by humans.",
