      "id": "claim_712c8205df1d4e7b93a02c9450910076",
      "statement": "The PRD's pull-request terminal stage is absent in every direction: there is no `ProcessPullRequestWebhookAsync` override, no pull-request REST operation (the outbound Octokit surface is `PostCommentAsync` and `CloseIssueAsync` only), and no per-run or per-day cost limit because `SebastianConfig` carries only `GitHub` and `Agent` sections with no budget fields.",
