      "id": "claim_5e401e58ee60458bb1d7c217fd79e1bc",
      "statement": "There is no regression net on the intent boundary itself: nothing tests `GitHubWebhookProcessor` or `GitHubService`, so intake guards, the validation-before-approval ordering, the comment text, the `not_planned` close, the enqueue path, and the absence of PR/label/cost machinery rest on review alone; the pinned behavior is limited to spec validation, workspace preparation, queue admission/error isolation, and the role's option shape.",
